  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nAre you ready to party?\n\nFor a truly special experience, celebrate your child’s next birthday at SOFO Museum!\n\nLed by our party specialists, 1 hour 30 mins of games, activities, trails and ‘make-and-takes’ inspired by our unique collections! Choose from a range of themes to suit your child, ages 5-9.\n\n£275.00 for up to 10 children\n\nEach additional child £30.00 (up to 15 children).\n\nYou can host your own birthday tea FREE OF CHARGE.\n\nFor more information, and to book, email us at engagement@sofo.org.uk\n\n \n\n \n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum is a recommended venue for SPY:Co parties!\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nWhat people are saying:\n\n\"It was such a special place to hold a party - and something really different. The camouflage face painting was very realistic, the code breaking trail held their interest, and everyone was happy to see their rockets launch in the beautiful gardens (and you went the extra mile to make sure all the rockets launched successfully, including the last one!). We were very lucky with the weather!\"\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
  "footerText": ""
}